            <span class="reveal scramble beam-text" data-text="CHAT WIDGET" style="--reveal-delay:.12s">CHAT WIDGET</span><br />
            <span class="reveal scramble" data-text="FOR YOUR APP" style="--reveal-delay:.24s">FOR YOUR APP</span>
          </h1>
